---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout lang="en" title="Electric vehicle charging for venues" activeNav="/podia" bodyClass="page-podia">
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-split">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h2 class="hero-h2">Power for the performance</h2>
          <p class="hero-lead">Many venues already have a large grid connection. It was sized for the evening, when the audience arrives and the stage lighting, sound and other equipment are running together. The building is busy during the day too, but usually draws much less power. That spare capacity can give a touring truck somewhere to charge on your existing connection.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-figure">
          <img src="/images/maria-mena-1200.jpg" srcset="/images/maria-mena-600.jpg 600w, /images/maria-mena-1200.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 46vw" alt="Maria Mena with Amsterdam Sinfonietta at the Concertgebouw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="800">
          <figcaption>Maria Mena with Amsterdam Sinfonietta<br>Photo by Fotono Photography</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="claim-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <p>One contract, one invoice and one number to call.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="page-hero page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Charging at your venue</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Buying a fast charger is only the first step. The equipment needs maintaining, customers need billing and someone needs to track CO₂ savings. Stroomlijnen brings those jobs together in a single service.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section id="techniek">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="what-box">
        <h2 class="what-h2">A fully managed charger</h2>
        <div class="what-row">
          <div>
            <p class="what-title">What Stroomlijnen provides</p>
            <div class="what-list">
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>DC fast charger</strong> — modular, 120 kW, CCS2 connector</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>OCPP 2.0.1 charging platform</strong> — our servers, app and software</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>24/7 monitoring</strong> — remote diagnostics and a response within four hours</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Billing and collection</strong> — we handle the administration and pay you monthly</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>CO₂ reporting</strong> — savings data for your sustainability report</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Emission reduction units</strong> — proceeds from eligible charging go to the Cultuurfonds</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Mobile backup charger</strong> — a replacement on site within 24 hours if the charger fails</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="what-title">Your venue’s role</p>
            <div class="what-list">
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Make room</strong> — near the loading dock, close to your main power supply</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Supply electricity</strong> — use spare daytime capacity on your existing connection</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Provide internet</strong> — a wired connection</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Arrange installation</strong> — your installer connects the charger to the distribution board</p></div>
              <div class="what-item"><p><strong>Receive payment</strong> — automatically each month, based on the kWh supplied</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="trio">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="trio-grid">
        <div class="trio-panel">
          <h3>Charger specifications</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Modular 120 kW DC fast charger</li>
            <li>CCS2 connector for trucks, vans and cars</li>
            <li>Four hours at 120 kW delivers up to 480 kWh before losses</li>
            <li>OCPP 2.0.1 with Plug &amp; Charge</li>
            <li>24/7 monitoring, remote diagnostics and a response within four hours</li>
            <li>Uses available capacity on the venue’s existing grid connection</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>120 kW DC fast charger · Brochure (PDF)</strong><br /><a href="https://docs.stroomlijnen.nl/brochures/Stroomlijnen-120kW-DC-snellader-Brochure-EN.pdf" download="" aria-label="120 kW DC fast charger · English (PDF)">English ↓</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="https://docs.stroomlijnen.nl/brochures/Stroomlijnen-120kW-DC-snellader-Brochure-NL.pdf" download="" aria-label="120 kW DC fast charger · Nederlands (PDF)">Nederlands ↓</a></p>
        </div>
        <figure class="trio-figure">
          <img src="/images/concertgebouw-lader-800.jpg" alt="Stroomlijnen charger at the Concertgebouw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="1422">
        </figure>
        <div class="trio-panel">
          <h3>Example venue investment</h3>
          <dl class="trio-cijfers">
            <div><dt>Purchase price</dt><dd class="groen">€36,000</dd></div>
            <div><dt>After the venue discount<strong class="asterix">*</strong></dt><dd class="groen">€27,000</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Illustrative SPRILA grant (40%)</dt><dd class="korting">−€10,800</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Net investment in this example</dt><dd>€16,200</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Illustrative payback</dt><dd>5 years</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="trio-noot"><strong>*</strong> <strong class="noot-vraag">How does the venue discount work?</strong> Venues choosing the fully integrated Stroomlijnen charging platform receive a one-off discount of €9,000 excluding VAT.<br>The discount helps offset the venue’s donation of ERE proceeds to the Cultuurfonds.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="what-kicker">FAQ</p>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq-item"><h4>Does our connection have enough capacity?</h4><p>Theatres are usually sized for the evening performance. During the day, spare capacity can go to the charger. At a steady 60 kW, ten hours of charging can supply up to 600 kWh before losses. Our EMS automatically limits the charger to the power available within your contract.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h4>Will charging affect the show?</h4><p>The show takes priority. The Stroomlijnen platform measures the building’s demand in real time and adjusts the charger accordingly. Most charging takes place during the day or overnight.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h4>How much power do we need?</h4><p>For touring trucks we recommend at least 60 kW DC. A typical charging window is seven to ten hours, depending on the vehicle and its starting charge. A 120 kW charger gives you more scope to charge during the day and pause for the evening performance. A 22 kW AC charger can suit lighter vans and touring vehicles.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h4>What about safety and insurance?</h4><p>The hardware includes automatic fault detection, an emergency stop and a connection for a fire alarm system. Each charger has its own digital identity and communicates over a private network. Stroomlijnen can provide the equipment documentation for your insurer.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h4>What if we rent the building from the council?</h4><p>You’ll need the owner’s permission. Stroomlijnen can help with the process and provide technical documentation for your council or landlord.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h4>Who installs and maintains the charger?</h4><p>Your installer connects the equipment. Stroomlijnen commissions it and takes care of maintenance, software updates and 24/7 monitoring.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h4>How long does installation take?</h4><p>Chargers in stock can be delivered within one working week of ordering. When stock needs replenishing, allow up to seven additional weeks. Installation and commissioning take one to two days.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container cta-block">
      <h2>Talk through your options</h2>
      <p>We’ll review the site and your grid connection with you, then explain what will work for your venue. There’s no obligation.</p>
      <a href="https://stroomlijnen.nl/en/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Arrange a conversation →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
